\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Come, Thou long-expected Jesus,
\par Born to set thy people free,
\par From our fears and sins release us,
\par Let us find our rest in Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Israel's strength and consolation,
\par Hope of all the earth Thou art;
\par Dear Desire of every nation,
\par Joy of every longing heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Born Thy people to deliver,
\par Born a child and yet a king,
\par Born to reign in us for ever,
\par Now Thy gracious kingdom bring.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. By Thine own eternal Spirit,
\par Rule in all our hearts alone;
\par By Thine all-sufficient merit
\par Raise us to Thy glorious throne.
\par                                    Amen.
\par 
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

